13556,1,"Enter the path you want to visit. Examples:\nLocal path: C:\\Program Files\nRelative path: ..\\doc\nUNC path: \\\\server\\share\nPlugin path: REG:\\HKEY_USERS\nArchive path: C:\\archive.zip"
